From 60d8b0cb1aaaaaa9495c493cf84469d405a489a1 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Claude <noreply@anthropic.com>
Date: Fri, 2 Oct 2026 20:11:39 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] Limit shareholder time adjustments; request-more flow; admin
 date/time adjust; customer on log; fix mobile chart overflow

- Shareholders: max 60 min per adjustment, 6 adjustments per day
- After the limit a 'Request more adjustments' button asks the Main Admin
- Main Admin chooses how many extra adjustments to grant (valid that day)
- Main Admin adjusts expiry with a date + time selector, no limit
- Spinner + lock on add/request buttons so a click can't spend several adjustments
- Time adjustments log now records the customer the time was added for
- Dashboard chart pairs stack on small screens instead of overflowing
